<title>ICELAND: SOCCER-KOSICE BEAT AKRANES 1-0 IN EUROPEAN CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KOSICE BEAT AKRANES 1-0 IN EUROPEAN CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1FV Kosice of Slovakia beat</p>
<p>Iceland's Akranes 1-0 in the second leg of their European Cup</p>
<p>qualifying round tie played on Wednesday, to record a 4-0</p>
<p>aggregate win.</p>
</text>
